title: International Relations
new-page: true
is-card: true
tags: party_affairs
view-if: international_relations_timer <= 0
on-arrival: month_actions += 1; international_relations_timer += 12;
card-image: img/kmtinternat.jpg
max-visits: 4
#subtitle: Building ties with foreign contacts.

We have some limited contacts with foreign powers, we should use this to our advantage.

- @west: Build relationships with the French, British and Germans to negotiate our unequal treaties and concessions.
- @soviet: Continue cooperating with Stalin and the Soviet Union
- @comintern: Get important military advisors and equipment through the Comintern
- @japan: Try to build relationships with the Japanese Empire.
- @return: We do not need international contacts at the moment.
- @easy_discard
- @cancel_advisor_action

@west
subtitle: -1 resources
choose-if: resources >= 1
unavailable-subtitle: Not enough resources.
on-arrival: resources -= 1; west_relation += 1;

Negotiating with the French and British is undeniably hard. And it may take giving up a few cities to renegotiate our indemnities.

@comintern
subtitle: -1 resources 
choose-if: east_relation >= 1
unavailable-subtitle: The Soviets won't just let us have them for free.
on-arrival: left_strength += 1; nra_militancy += 0.1; resources -= 1; east_relation -= 1;

Our army can learn much in military organization and training from Soviet advisors and guns.

@soviet
subtitle: -1 resources
choose-if: resources >= 1
unavailable-subtitle: Not enough resources.
on-arrival: left_strength =+ 1; center_left_strength =+ 1; east_relation += 2; cpc_realtion += 1;

Sun Yat-sen's support of cooperation with the Soviet Union may bring benefits for our movement.

@comintern
subtitle: -1 resources
choose-if: resources >= 1
unavailable-subtitle: Not enough resources.
on-arrival: resources -= 1; kpd_relation += 5*(1-dissent); communist_coalition += 1 if comintern_seen == 0; comintern_seen += 1

The Stalinists of the KPD insists on calling us "social fascists", suggesting that we social democrats are as bad or worse than actual fascists. Needless to say, this is not good for our relationship with the Communists. By observing the Comintern, we can better understand the KPD, enabling us to potentially improve relations, or counter the KPD if it may come to that.

@japan
subtitle: -1 resources
choose-if: resources >= 1
unavailable-subtitle: Not enough resources.
on-arrival: resources -= 1; japan_relations += 1;

Japan doesn't care for us at all right now.

@reduce

We do not need the international contacts at the moment.
